    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present Moygrehan a well presented large 4 bedroom detached family home situated on a mature 0.40 acre site located outside the town of Athboy. The property extends to approximately 175sqm of well-proportioned accommodation with a versatile floor plan. \r\nThe B rated house qualifies for a green mortgage, is presented to the market in excellent condition and has benefitted from a number of upgrades by the current owner including a new kitchen, refurbished bathrooms, star link connection.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor consists of an entrance hall, bay window living room, kitchen, separate dining room and a bathroom. On the first floor there are four bedrooms including a master ensuite with walk in wardrobe and a main bathroom. The owner has tastefully upgraded the kitchen, bathrooms and carried out significant energy efficiency improvements . The driveway provides access to both the sides and rear of the house. The garden includes an orchard with a variety fruit trees planted throughout, and is bounded by mature hedging providing a sense of privacy. \r\n\r\nMoygrehan is located on the Athboy / Clonmellon Roard, 3km from the village of Clonmellon, 7km outside of Athboy and 13km from Kells. The town of Athboy is an hour’s drive to Dublin City Centre while there is also public transport providing a daily bus service which leaves Athboy multiple times per day."
      },
